Custom emoji tapbacks (reactionType "emoji:👀" / "-emoji:👀" -> associatedMessageType 2006/3006),
per-part text styles and effects on send-multipart, and a guard for the typing handler, which crashed Messages
when a request arrived without a transactionId. Written for a patched BlueBubbles setup on macOS 15 (2026-09-21).

